<title>GERMANY: German grain trade seeks intvn rye exports.</title>
<headline>German grain trade seeks intvn rye exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders bid for the export of 52,842 tonnes of rye from intervention stores to third countries, state grain intervention board BLE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>This was under the weekly European Union grain tender.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
